# Line endings: normalise in the repository, check out LF everywhere. Without this, a
# Windows clone rewrites the Feature's shell scripts to CRLF — and a CRLF install.sh
# fails inside the container with an unhelpful "bad interpreter" error.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt and braces for the files where a CRLF is fatal rather than merely untidy.
*.sh text eol=lf
.zshrc text eol=lf
.czrc text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf

# No export-ignore section: this repository is published as OCI Feature artifacts by
# the devcontainers action, not as a source archive, so `git archive` plays no part.
